{{JPExclusive}}

==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has finally surpassed 34 million downloads worldwide!!<br>
A limited-time campaign will be held to commemorate this!

{{Color|#FF00FF|'''The event period is scheduled for February 1st (11:00) to February 14th, 2018 (10:59) !'''}}<br>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●34 Million Downloads Memorial Stages appear!'''}}<br>
Hellish stages of the highest difficulty level return......?!<br>
Challenge Deadly stages!<br>
During the campaign, move to Legend Story (Event Stage) from the title screen of the "The Battle Cats" app, tap the "Battle Start!!" button, and {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Deadly Carnival!" and "Deadly Carnival II"'''}} will appear!<br>
You can get 3 Cat Tickets by clearing stage 1 and 1 Rare Ticket by clearing stage 2!!<br>
Don't miss this chance!<br>
<small><small>※If you already earned the clear rewards from "Deadly Carnival" and "Deadly Carnival II" during a previous event, you will not be able to acquire them again.<br>
※If the stages are not displayed, you need to update the app to the latest version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●During the event period, the energy cost of "Legend Stages" will be halved for a limited time!'''}}<br>
Release the Legend Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF6600|'''"Legend Stage"'''}} {{Color|#FF00FF|'''energy costs'''}} will only be halved at the following times during the event period!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''7:00～9:00 / 12:00～14:00 / 19:00～21:00'''}}

Take this opportunity to clear "Legend Stages"!<br>
<small><small>※"Legend Stages" will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1.<br>
※"Special Stages" and "Collab Stages" are not subject to half energy costs.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●"Treasure Fest☆Festival" is held!'''}}<br>
A limited-time {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Festival'''}} will be held throughout the period, with a significant increase in Treasure drop rates!<br>
During the campaign period, it will be held on {{Color|#FF6600|'''even-numbered days (2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12, 2/14) '''}} in the {{Color|#008000|'''"Japan Arc"'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd-numbered days (2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13) '''}} in the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Future Arc"'''}}!<br>

Plus, it will also be held in the {{Color|#335599|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}}！<br>
The {{Color|#335599|'''"Cosmos Arc"'''}} Treasure Festival will be held on {{Color|#335599|'''2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12'''}}!<br>
<small>※"Japan Arc" and "Future Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1, "Cosmos Arc" Treasure Festivals will appear after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Get lots of XP! "Super Guerrilla XP Special" is held!'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, lots of guerrilla XP stages where you can get lots of XP appear!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"XP Stage" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Even-numbered days（2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13）・・・11：00～14：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Even-numbered days（2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12）・・・19：00～22：00'''}}

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"XP Megablitz!" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Odd-numbered days（2/1, 2/3, 2/5, 2/7, 2/9, 2/11, 2/13）・・・19：00～22：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Even-numbered days（2/2, 2/4, 2/6, 2/8, 2/10, 2/12）・・・11：00～14：00'''}}

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"XP Colosseum" appearance schedule'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/4, 2/7, 2/10, 2/13・・・16：00～17：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/2, 2/5, 2/8, 2/11・・・22：00～23：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12・・・8：00～9：00'''}}

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・"Merciless XP!" appearance schedule"'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/1, 2/4, 2/7, 2/10, 2/13・・・22：00～23：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/2, 2/5, 2/8, 2/11, 2/14・・・8：00～9：00'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''2/3, 2/6, 2/9, 2/12・・・16：00～17：00'''}}

Take this opportunity to play the stages and get XP!

<small>※In addition the above schedule, "XP Stage" and "XP Megablitz!" will also appear as normal.<br>
※"XP Megablitz!" is playable after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3, "XP Colosseum" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 1, "Merciless XP!" after clearing "Future Arc" Chapter 3.</small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited campaign! "Catamin Limited Capsules" and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" appear!'''}}<br>
By tapping the buttons in the top left of the Cat Capsule screen, you can switch to the {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catamin Limited Capsules" and "Catfruit Limited Capsules"'''}}!<br>
Take this chance to get lots of items and strengthen GAMATOTO Expedition and your characters!<br>
<small><small>※"Catamin Limited Capsules" provide Catamins and XP, while "Catfruit Limited Capsules" provide Catfruit, XP and various items.<br>
※"Catseye Limited Capsules" will appear after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 1, and "Catfruit Limited Capsules" will appear in the Cat Capsules after clearing "Japan Arc" Chapter 3.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Daily Cat Food present!'''}}<br>
During the event period, open the "The Battle Cats" app for a
daily 20 Cat Food present!'''<br>
Play the game every day, GET Cat Food!

